Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,"At night, a mysterious sound\Nleaves me unable to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,"There are more stray cats\Nand dogs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Grandfather went for a walk\Nand hasn't returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,"The nearby forest suddenly fell silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a few days now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,the livestock has been afraid of\Nsomething and it's causing problems."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,And this is where\Neach of these has occurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Similar to the incident\Nin the Forest of Beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:40.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,if the enemy has already encroached\Nthis deep into our country...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,All members who can use\NSearch and Uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:45.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,will form a group and dispatch\Nto the areas indicated, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,And call for all Six Sovereigns,\Nthis is an emergency summons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,All of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.33,0:00:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did I not\Ntake notice of this earlier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What in the world is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Those bastards of the Magical Empire,\Nare they really going this far?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell did our country\Ndo to them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,They want the dungeon's resources\Nso badly they'd resort to this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do they not understand how many\Ninnocent lives are in the line of fire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is... this is just like...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,like they're coming to this country\Nto demolish it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good thing we got compensated\Nin the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good grief,\Nguess I'll do you a favor then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's in celebration of your first hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,One goblin only gets you\Nso much anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.71,0:03:24.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Food sure tastes better\Nafter finishing our first hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But how long is this girl\Ngoing to stick around?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her folks must be worried about her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, I think I'll head back\Nto my home for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.88,0:03:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is that okay, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:45.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is that okay, Instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You truly were a big help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.04,0:03:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I'll assist you again\Nif you don't mind me doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So this is where you've been, Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.08,0:04:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.67,0:04:05.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I apologize for bringing\Nthis up so suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:08.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,but will you head to a city\Nin the mountain district
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,tomorrow morning with Lynne?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a carriage\Nas well as one escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm unable to give you\Nany more details right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I'd like you to cooperate with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see. Sounds like I'll need\Nto pack for this journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will pay you well\Nand cover your travel expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.83,0:04:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are the sole person\NI can rely on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We ended up taking his request\Nthrough the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Master did say to relax
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,and go on a long journey\Nsince it's a pretty sweet deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the real reason I accepted\Nthe task this time is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never been on a carriage before,\Nand I just wanted to see what it's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,To me, who only knows places\Naround the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,this is the greatest compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems like if luck is with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to go\Nto other countries, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne, don't you wanna see the scenery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:21.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just about time\Nfor the wheat harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We sure do live in a land of plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to become a normal adventurer\Nand journey on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry my brother\Nburdened you with this request.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm getting paid for this,\Nand I owe you for the goblin hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, you'll travel\Nnorthwest of the capital via carriage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,heading towards\Nthe mountain district of Toros,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,then you two will just sit tight\Nthere for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,After that, if nothing especially\Nabnormal happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,then you'll cross the mountain\Nand head towards the neighboring land,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Holy Theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay\Nthat I'm just going along?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's something like a trip...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is, if nothing happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I truly hope nothing will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I received a secret order\Nfrom the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the near future,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,the royal capital will fall\Ninto an unprecedented crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should you receive report of\Nthe destruction of the capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,At that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:53.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,take Lynne together with Sir Noor,\Nand flee to The Holy Theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Does Lady Lynneburg know of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:02.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I had, she'd surely say\Nshe's staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't be away from the capital\Nif there is an emergency...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This duty of yours\Nis of the utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are the only one\NI can trust Lynne with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must bring her somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.71,0:07:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I apologize that you're\Ncaught up in this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You make a simple trip\Nsound so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,More importantly, you haven't\Nbeen looking too well this whole trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just a little worried\Nabout something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keeping you safe is another one\Nof my responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.13,0:07:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not really worried\Nabout anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I intend to protect myself\Nas much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm confident I can run away if needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You won't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:09.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,A shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks you don't have\Nanything though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,In my case, I don't need\Nto have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rather, it's better in\Nmany ways if I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'd be easier to just show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Divine Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is your shield, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.46,0:08:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If anything happens,\Nhide yourself behind this shield of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Neither weapons nor magic can\Nget through this, for the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see. I'll do that then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to Lynne, that man with\Nthe spear that let me train with him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,on the practice drill grounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think it was Gil...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Val? No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Armadillo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:09:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,His talent is so great\Nhe brought down a dragon on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And she is no less powerful than he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,A single goblin gives me so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're on a whole\Ndifferent level then I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is a remarkable talent, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Talent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I noticed there was\Na mysterious power within me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,shortly after being\Ntaken into an orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It sure is pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ouch! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Someone! Call Director Sain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.75,0:09:41.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Someone! Call Director Sain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I healed her, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, show me the power\Nyou were using.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a gift from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's more,\Na historically rare one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It could become a blade\Nto cut anyone down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,or a shield that can protect\Nagainst anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Depending on how you use it,\Nit can easily annihilate even a country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.63,0:10:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can learn to use it starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was taken in by\Nthe Sovereign Shield Dandalg,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I learned from the Six Sovereigns\Nhow to use my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even so, I couldn't dispel the fear\Nthat I would hurt someone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I started to put distance\Nbetween myself and others,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and became detached\Nfrom the things they said and did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,At least, that's what I'd thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,May I have your name,\Nif you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:04.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew the name of that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never let yourself get distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dandalg, the foster father who raised me,\Nand the instructor I held in high regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He would tell me about any little thing,\Nand I heard it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Another separate swarm of monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He would tell me about any little thing,\Nand I heard it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,are approaching from the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The state of affairs\Nis pretty tough right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The soldiers seem to be showing\Nsigns of fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Times like this...\NI wish that Noor was still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That name again...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:52.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oops, that slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A person worth recognition by Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:07.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The emotions that swelled up\Ninside me were so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seemed I was somehow still envious\Nof that man I'd never met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been even worse since that man\Nappeared in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I shouldn't let my feelings\Ncloud my judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am the Shield of the Clays Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I protect Lady Lynneburg with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a path in the wheat fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like someone made it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.58,0:12:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, is there something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I thought I saw something\Nmoving in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uncover!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So it has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Several beasts have appeared\Nall around the royal capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Warrior Corps are handling it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,but we don't have enough soldiers\Nfor the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have the swordsman troop block the\Nroads immediately to fend them off
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,while evacuating the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Reroute the Secret Corps and the\NHunter Corps to send as many as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,in order to fight the monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single citizen\Nbecome a casualty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That damn Deridas...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.29,0:14:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll regret those words!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's come to make good\Non that threat, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I fear this is just the beginning.\NI don't believe it will end with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suppose it will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the Sovereign Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've dispatched them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Powerful monsters were discovered\Nin various locations,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and each of them had no choice\Nbut to counter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Defend this place at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one of 'em through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:16.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean they've spread\Nour forces thin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.17,0:15:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne and the others are safe,\NI suspect they've arrived in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to kill them...\NI have to kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could that possibly be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,the Black Death Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.79,0:15:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is such a vicious monster\Nin a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait! That's a-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:22.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.17,0:16:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That boy didn't just happen to be there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,he appeared along\Nwith the Black Death Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:32.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,when you used your "Uncover" skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.25,0:16:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean, that kid is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Demonfolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've heard of them, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:41.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,They appear to be the same as humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they are demi-humans who have\Nthe special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:49.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,of establishing a mental bond\Nwith monsters at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If anything, they are closer\Nto monsters than humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,and are considered abhorrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are records from 200 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,when the Holy Theocracy of Mithra\Nwas almost wiped out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,by demi-humans who were\Nmanipulating powerful monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because of that the Demonfolk\Nwere exhaustively hunted by humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,and they were thought to be extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems their descendants\Nare somehow still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that is the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.54,0:17:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,then they must hold some\Nintense hatred towards humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then the boy manipulated\Nthe dragon to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They are monsters\Nthat dwell in the marshlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,They rarely go where humans reside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Basically, that boy clearly\Nintends to try and bring
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,that vicious monster\Nto the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The shock of being exposed by Uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,caused him to lose\Nhis mental hold on the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he'd rush to help\Nsomeone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excessively so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.88,0:18:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is he thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, let's assist him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:22.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will not help Sir Noor again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This frog...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not so powerful,\Nand moves slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That goblin was leagues tougher than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I can hold out until\NLynne and Ines get here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,we'll make it out of here all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I evade it now, the kid'll get hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.63,0:19:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the true horror of the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's poison... a deadly one at that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,My head's spinning...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't control my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines was trying to say something..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she want to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,that it wasn't a regular frog,\Nbut a poisonous one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It brings a black death\Nto all living things,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,thus it is called the\NBlack Death Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mustn't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next an even bigger\Npoisonous mist will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:41.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,My duty is to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I can hold back its attacks\Nhere somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,so at least the princess escapes...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,then there's a chance\Nto revive the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The very existence of the kingdom\Nis at stake here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Regardless, one breath of\Nthat noxious gas would be fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:05.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if the\NSovereign Healer Sain were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.75,0:20:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,recovery would be a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.79,0:20:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!\NQuick, get behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,For now, you just need to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Purify!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The purification won't\Nmake it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:42.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.33,0:20:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am but a mere soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.50,0:20:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I chose this path because I admired\Nthe Shield Sovereign Dandalg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If someone on the verge of danger is\Nin front of me I want to protect them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:20:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still? In that condition?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Times like this...\NI wish that Noor was still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that what he meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,He isn't foolish or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the kind of person\NI've always looked up to and chased after.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doing whatever you can to protect someone,\Neven if it means sacrificing yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,A true Shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that man... he's already...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's good...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can make this work out after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:11.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,#5 I Parry a Frog
